description: Rust coding standard for this repo (rustfmt and clippy enforced)
globs: ["**/*.rs", "**/Cargo.toml"]
alwaysApply: false
---

# Rust coding standard

- Edition 2024; `rustfmt` with `max_width = 80`.
- Clippy `pedantic` and `cargo` groups at warn; CI denies all warnings.
- `unsafe_code` is forbidden; `missing_docs` is on, so every public item has a `///` doc comment.
- Logic lives in `crates/rust-repo-template`; the CLI crate only parses arguments and prints.
- Run `mise run fmt lint test` after edits and `mise run verify` before finishing.
